{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgvq5SBL1itiFHZYqB5q7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017Tfnk9T4QLC6CRTLZNow9T","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/paper; rm -f paper.tex.bak_before_audit references.bib.bak_audit; ts=$(date -u +%FT%TZ); cat >> memory.md <<E\n\n### $ts | step=paper | scope=paper (audit repair)\n- summary: Fixed figure_manifest (figure_type paired_panel_bar -> bar; controls width 0.75). Audit repairs: normaliser sentence now says sports larger under both (about 6x/12x vs 10.5x/21.0x); qualified no longer read as certifying controls (gate criteria not recorded; controls reported as separate observations); evaluator-internal specifics (B1-B3 construction, thresholds, margin, abort/checksum, copy rescaling) removed or marked unverified; dev table limited to grounded totals/runtimes, sub-metrics flagged as quoted from search-stage log, configs 2/3 title-level only. Bib title glyph fixed for compile. Trimmed text to keep body at 9 pages.\n- evidence: verifier dangling=0; 29 claims, all source ids resolve; citation keys validated\nE\nfor f in global_memory/memory.md; do cat >> $f <<E\n\n### $ts | step=paper | scope=paper\n- summary: Audit-repair pass complete; paper.tex and claims_grounding.json consistent with grounded inputs; qualification gate criteria stated as unrecorded; evaluator internals not claimed.\nE\ndone\necho \"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"step\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Audit-repair pass complete; paper.tex and claims_grounding.json consistent with grounded inputs; qualification criteria unrecorded; evaluator internals not claimed.\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"$ts\\\"}\" >> global_memory/memory.jsonl"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":104003,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_inp